{"id":"/docs/components/drawer-25","page_id":"/docs/components/drawer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/drawer#keyboard","content":"Action"},"651":{"id":"/docs/components/drawer-26","page_id":"/docs/components/drawer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/drawer#keyboard","content":"`Escape`"},"652":{"id":"/docs/components/drawer-27","page_id":"/docs/components/drawer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/drawer#keyboard","content":"Close the drawer (unless `isKeyboardDismissDisabled`)"},"653":{"id":"/docs/components/drawer-28","page_id":"/docs/components/drawer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/drawer#keyboard","content":"`Tab`"},"654":{"id":"/docs/components/drawer-29","page_id":"/docs/components/drawer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/drawer#keyboard","content":"Move focus within the drawer (focus is trapped)"},"655":{"id":"/docs/components/drawer-30","page_id":"/docs/components/drawer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/drawer#aria","content":"`role=\"dialog\"` with `aria-modal=\"true\"` on the drawer panel (via RAC Modal)"},"656":{"id":"/docs/components/drawer-31","page_id":"/docs/components/drawer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/drawer#aria","content":"A `Heading slot=\"title\"` labels the dialog via `aria-labelledby`; otherwise pass `aria-label`"},"657":{"id":"/docs/components/drawer-32","page_id":"/docs/components/drawer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/drawer#best-practices","content":"Provide a `Heading slot=\"title\"` or an `aria-label` so the dialog has an accessible name."},"658":{"id":"/docs/components/drawer-33","page_id":"/docs/components/drawer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/drawer#best-practices","content":"Use `isDismissable` to allow closing via backdrop click."},"659":{"id":"/docs/components/drawer-34","page_id":"/docs/components/drawer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/drawer#best-practices","content":"Don't nest drawers."},"660":{"id":"/docs/components/drop-zone","page_id":"/docs/components/drop-zone","type":"page","content":"DropZone","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Components"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/drop-zone"},"661":{"id":"/docs/components/drop-zone-0","page_id":"/docs/components/drop-zone","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/drop-zone","content":"A standalone region that accepts drag-and-drop file interactions, rendering a clearly defined target area where users can drop files."},"662":{"id":"/docs/components/drop-zone-1","page_id":"/docs/components/drop-zone","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/drop-zone#installation","content":"Installation"},"663":{"id":"/docs/components/drop-zone-2","page_id":"/docs/components/drop-zone","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/drop-zone#examples","content":"Examples"},"664":{"id":"/docs/components/drop-zone-3","page_id":"/docs/components/drop-zone","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/drop-zone#default","content":"Default"},"665":{"id":"/docs/components/drop-zone-4","page_id":"/docs/components/drop-zone","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/drop-zone#disabled","content":"Disabled"},"666":{"id":"/docs/components/drop-zone-5","page_id":"/docs/components/drop-zone","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/drop-zone#file-upload","content":"File Upload"},"667":{"id":"/docs/components/drop-zone-6","page_id":"/docs/components/drop-zone","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/drop-zone#drop-target-label","content":"Drop Target Label"},"668":{"id":"/docs/components/drop-zone-7","page_id":"/docs/components/drop-zone","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/drop-zone#replace-existing-file","content":"Replace Existing File"},"669":{"id":"/docs/components/drop-zone-8","page_id":"/docs/components/drop-zone","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/drop-zone#accessibility","content":"Accessibility"},"670":{"id":"/docs/components/drop-zone-9","page_id":"/docs/components/drop-zone","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/drop-zone#keyboard","content":"Keyboard"},"671":{"id":"/docs/components/drop-zone-10","page_id":"/docs/components/drop-zone","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/drop-zone#screen-readers","content":"Screen readers"},"672":{"id":"/docs/components/drop-zone-11","page_id":"/docs/components/drop-zone","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/drop-zone#best-practices","content":"Best Practices"},"673":{"id":"/docs/components/drop-zone-12","page_id":"/docs/components/drop-zone","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/drop-zone#props","content":"Props"},"674":{"id":"/docs/components/drop-zone-13","page_id":"/docs/components/drop-zone","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/drop-zone#dropzone","content":"DropZone"},"675":{"id":"/docs/components/drop-zone-14","page_id":"/docs/components/drop-zone","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/drop-zone#default","content":"A minimal drop zone. The `onDrop` callback receives the dropped items; use the exported `isFileDropItem` guard to narrow them to files. Wrap the instructional text in `<Text slot=\"label\">` so it labels the visually hidden drop button for screen readers."},"676":{"id":"/docs/components/drop-zone-15","page_id":"/docs/components/drop-zone","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/drop-zone#disabled","content":"Set `isDisabled` to prevent the drop zone from accepting interactions. The zone is dimmed and the cursor indicates it is not interactive."},"677":{"id":"/docs/components/drop-zone-16","page_id":"/docs/components/drop-zone","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/drop-zone#file-upload","content":"A reference composition combining `DropZone` with `FileTrigger` to support both click-to-browse and drag-and-drop. Use this as a starting point and adapt the accepted formats, size limit, and handlers to your product's requirements."},"678":{"id":"/docs/components/drop-zone-17","page_id":"/docs/components/drop-zone","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/drop-zone#drop-target-label","content":"Pass a render-prop function as `children` to change the zone's content while a valid drag is active. Branching on `isDropTarget` requires no extra state. Pair it with `getDropOperation` to reject unsupported types - the label only appears when the drag is accepted."},"679":{"id":"/docs/components/drop-zone-18","page_id":"/docs/components/drop-zone","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/drop-zone#replace-existing-file","content":"Use `children` as a render function to show different content based on the current zone state - here, swapping the default label for \"Drop to replace\" when a file is already selected and a new drag is active. The same `onDrop` handler services both the drag path and the `FileTrigger` click path, so either gesture replaces the selection."},"680":{"id":"/docs/components/drop-zone-19","page_id":"/docs/components/drop-zone","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/drop-zone#keyboard","content":"Key"},"681":{"id":"/docs/components/drop-zone-20","page_id":"/docs/components/drop-zone","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/drop-zone#keyboard","content":"Description"},"682":{"id":"/docs/components/drop-zone-21","page_id":"/docs/components/drop-zone","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/drop-zone#keyboard","content":"`Tab`"},"683":{"id":"/docs/components/drop-zone-22","page_id":"/docs/components/drop-zone","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/drop-zone#keyboard","content":"Moves focus to the drop zone"},"684":{"id":"/docs/components/drop-zone-23","page_id":"/docs/components/drop-zone","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/drop-zone#keyboard","content":"`Enter` / `Space`"},"685":{"id":"/docs/components/drop-zone-24","page_id":"/docs/components/drop-zone","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/drop-zone#keyboard","content":"Opens the file picker so files can be selected without a pointer"},"686":{"id":"/docs/components/drop-zone-25","page_id":"/docs/components/drop-zone","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/drop-zone#screen-readers","content":"The drop zone renders a visually hidden `<button>` inside the container. Assistive technology discovers and announces this button as an interactive element — activating it opens the native file picker without a pointer."},"687":{"id":"/docs/components/drop-zone-26","page_id":"/docs/components/drop-zone","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/drop-zone#screen-readers","content":"The button's accessible name is built from two sources, combined in order:"},"688":{"id":"/docs/components/drop-zone-27","page_id":"/docs/components/drop-zone","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/drop-zone#screen-readers","content":"**`<Text slot=\"label\">`** — any `Text` child with `slot=\"label\"` has its `id` linked to the button via `aria-labelledby`. This is the recommended way to provide a contextual label that is also visible to sighted users."},"689":{"id":"/docs/components/drop-zone-28","page_id":"/docs/components/drop-zone","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/drop-zone#screen-readers","content":"**`aria-label`** — pass `aria-label` on the `DropZone` component to override or supplement the label (e.g. `aria-label=\"Upload profile photo\"`). When no `Text slot=\"label\"` is present and no `aria-label` is set, the button falls back to the default \"DropZone\" label provided by React Aria."},"690":{"id":"/docs/components/drop-zone-29","page_id":"/docs/components/drop-zone","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/drop-zone#best-practices","content":"Use the drop zone alongside a button-based file picker — drag-and-drop is a convenience, never the only way to upload."},"691":{"id":"/docs/components/drop-zone-30","page_id":"/docs/components/drop-zone","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/drop-zone#best-practices","content":"Replace the default text with `children` to communicate the accepted file types and size limits up front."},"692":{"id":"/docs/components/drop-zone-31","page_id":"/docs/components/drop-zone","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/drop-zone#best-practices","content":"Let the drop zone fill its container; constrain it with the surrounding layout rather than setting a fixed width on the component itself."},"693":{"id":"/docs/components/drop-zone-32","page_id":"/docs/components/drop-zone","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/drop-zone#best-practices","content":"Reflect upload state (validating, uploading, error) outside the drop zone so the target area stays clear and predictable."},"694":{"id":"/docs/components/field-error","page_id":"/docs/components/field-error","type":"page","content":"FieldError","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Components"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/field-error"},"695":{"id":"/docs/components/field-error-0","page_id":"/docs/components/field-error","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/field-error","content":"Validation message for a field. Renders only when the field is invalid."},"696":{"id":"/docs/components/field-error-1","page_id":"/docs/components/field-error","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/field-error#features","content":"Features"},"697":{"id":"/docs/components/field-error-2","page_id":"/docs/components/field-error","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/field-error#installation","content":"Installation"},"698":{"id":"/docs/components/field-error-3","page_id":"/docs/components/field-error","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/field-error#examples","content":"Examples"},"699":{"id":"/docs/components/field-error-4","page_id":"/docs/components/field-error","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/field-error#default","content":"Default"},"700":{"id":"/docs/components/field-error-5","page_id":"/docs/components/field-error","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/field-error#props","content":"Props"},"701":{"id":"/docs/components/field-error-6","page_id":"/docs/components/field-error","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/field-error#fielderror","content":"FieldError"},"702":{"id":"/docs/components/field-error-7","page_id":"/docs/components/field-error","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/field-error#features","content":"Shown when the parent field is invalid (`isInvalid` or native constraint validation)."},"703":{"id":"/docs/components/field-error-8","page_id":"/docs/components/field-error","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/field-error#default","content":"FieldError renders when the field is invalid."},"704":{"id":"/docs/components/file-trigger","page_id":"/docs/components/file-trigger","type":"page","content":"FileTrigger","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Components"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/file-trigger"},"705":{"id":"/docs/components/file-trigger-0","page_id":"/docs/components/file-trigger","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/file-trigger","content":"A style-less primitive that wraps any pressable component and opens the native file picker when it is activated."},"706":{"id":"/docs/components/file-trigger-1","page_id":"/docs/components/file-trigger","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/file-trigger#features","content":"Features"},"707":{"id":"/docs/components/file-trigger-2","page_id":"/docs/components/file-trigger","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/file-trigger#installation","content":"Installation"},"708":{"id":"/docs/components/file-trigger-3","page_id":"/docs/components/file-trigger","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/file-trigger#examples","content":"Examples"},"709":{"id":"/docs/components/file-trigger-4","page_id":"/docs/components/file-trigger","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/file-trigger#default","content":"Default"},"710":{"id":"/docs/components/file-trigger-5","page_id":"/docs/components/file-trigger","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/file-trigger#accepted-types","content":"Accepted Types"},"711":{"id":"/docs/components/file-trigger-6","page_id":"/docs/components/file-trigger","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/file-trigger#accessibility","content":"Accessibility"},"712":{"id":"/docs/components/file-trigger-7","page_id":"/docs/components/file-trigger","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/file-trigger#best-practices","content":"Best Practices"},"713":{"id":"/docs/components/file-trigger-8","page_id":"/docs/components/file-trigger","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/file-trigger#props","content":"Props"},"714":{"id":"/docs/components/file-trigger-9","page_id":"/docs/components/file-trigger","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/file-trigger#filetrigger","content":"FileTrigger"},"715":{"id":"/docs/components/file-trigger-10","page_id":"/docs/components/file-trigger","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/file-trigger#features","content":"Turns any pressable component (such as an Antares `Button`) into a file picker trigger."},"716":{"id":"/docs/components/file-trigger-11","page_id":"/docs/components/file-trigger","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/file-trigger#features","content":"Renders a visually hidden `<input type=\"file\">` — no styling of its own."},"717":{"id":"/docs/components/file-trigger-12","page_id":"/docs/components/file-trigger","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/file-trigger#features","content":"Restricts selection by MIME type, allows multiple files, directory selection, and camera capture."},"718":{"id":"/docs/components/file-trigger-13","page_id":"/docs/components/file-trigger","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/file-trigger#features","content":"Resets the input value before every open, so re-selecting the same file still fires `onSelect`."},"719":{"id":"/docs/components/file-trigger-14","page_id":"/docs/components/file-trigger","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/file-trigger#default","content":"Wrap any pressable component. Activating the child opens the native file picker; the selected files arrive in `onSelect`."},"720":{"id":"/docs/components/file-trigger-15","page_id":"/docs/components/file-trigger","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/file-trigger#accepted-types","content":"Restrict the picker to specific MIME types with `acceptedFileTypes`, and allow more than one file with `allowsMultiple`."},"721":{"id":"/docs/components/file-trigger-16","page_id":"/docs/components/file-trigger","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/file-trigger#accessibility","content":"`FileTrigger` adds no visuals or ARIA of its own — accessibility comes from the pressable child you provide. Use a component with an accessible name (e.g. an Antares `Button` with clear label text) so assistive technology announces the action. The underlying `<input>` is visually hidden but remains operable by keyboard through the child's press behavior."},"722":{"id":"/docs/components/file-trigger-17","page_id":"/docs/components/file-trigger","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/file-trigger#best-practices","content":"`acceptedFileTypes` is a best-effort filter for the OS picker — always validate file type and size again in your `onSelect` handler, since it can be bypassed."},"723":{"id":"/docs/components/file-trigger-18","page_id":"/docs/components/file-trigger","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/file-trigger#best-practices","content":"Pair `FileTrigger` with `DropZone` to offer both click-to-browse and drag-and-drop. See the DropZone \"File Upload\" example."},"724":{"id":"/docs/components/file-trigger-19","page_id":"/docs/components/file-trigger","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/file-trigger#best-practices","content":"Keep the child a single pressable element; `FileTrigger` forwards press behavior to whatever you nest inside it."},"725":{"id":"/docs/components/heading","page_id":"/docs/components/heading","type":"page","content":"Heading","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Components"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/heading"},"726":{"id":"/docs/components/heading-0","page_id":"/docs/components/heading","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/heading","content":"Semantic h1-h6 heading. Use slot=\"title\" inside a Modal or Dialog to name the overlay."},"727":{"id":"/docs/components/heading-1","page_id":"/docs/components/heading","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/heading#features","content":"Features"},"728":{"id":"/docs/components/heading-2","page_id":"/docs/components/heading","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/heading#installation","content":"Installation"},"729":{"id":"/docs/components/heading-3","page_id":"/docs/components/heading","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/heading#examples","content":"Examples"},"730":{"id":"/docs/components/heading-4","page_id":"/docs/components/heading","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/heading#default","content":"Default"},"731":{"id":"/docs/components/heading-5","page_id":"/docs/components/heading","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/heading#sizes","content":"Sizes"},"732":{"id":"/docs/components/heading-6","page_id":"/docs/components/heading","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/heading#props","content":"Props"},"733":{"id":"/docs/components/heading-7","page_id":"/docs/components/heading","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/heading#heading","content":"Heading"},"734":{"id":"/docs/components/heading-8","page_id":"/docs/components/heading","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/heading#features","content":"Renders `h1`-`h6` from the `level` prop (default `3`). The level never changes the visual size."},"735":{"id":"/docs/components/heading-9","page_id":"/docs/components/heading","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/heading#features","content":"Without `size`, takes the heading tier of the surrounding `SizeProvider`.\n`size` picks a step on the heading ramp (`xs` to `2xl`)."},"736":{"id":"/docs/components/heading-10","page_id":"/docs/components/heading","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/heading#features","content":"`emphasis` picks a feedback color and changes only the color."},"737":{"id":"/docs/components/heading-11","page_id":"/docs/components/heading","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/heading#features","content":"`slot=\"title\"` inside a `Modal` or `Dialog` sets the accessible name, and takes the overlay's\ntitle tier, one step above the heading tier."},"738":{"id":"/docs/components/heading-12","page_id":"/docs/components/heading","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/heading#default","content":"`Heading` renders a semantic `h1`-`h6` element via the `level` prop.\nInside a `Modal`/`Dialog`, add `slot=\"title\"` and it labels the dialog automatically."},"739":{"id":"/docs/components/heading-13","page_id":"/docs/components/heading","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/heading#sizes","content":"`level` sets the semantics and `size` sets the look, so the two never have to match. Without\n`size`, a heading takes the size scope's heading tier at any level."},"740":{"id":"/docs/components/icon","page_id":"/docs/components/icon","type":"page","content":"Icon","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Components"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/icon"},"741":{"id":"/docs/components/icon-0","page_id":"/docs/components/icon","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/icon","content":"Flexible SVG icon component with on-demand loading, automatic caching, and extensive customization options"},"742":{"id":"/docs/components/icon-1","page_id":"/docs/components/icon","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/icon#features","content":"Features"},"743":{"id":"/docs/components/icon-2","page_id":"/docs/components/icon","type":"heading","tags":[],"url